==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈbɛkən/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɛkən|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{context|ambitransitive|lang=en}} To [[wave]] and/or to [[nod]] to [[somebody]] with the [[intention]] to [[make]] the [[person]] [[come]] [[closer]].
#* Dryden
#*: His distant friends, he '''beckons''' near.
#* Shakespeare
#*: It '''beckons''' you to go away with it.

